 (~$40B–$45B run-rate)\"]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Scarcity premium erosion, post-IPO lockup expirations, launch cadence plateaus.\"]]]]]],[null,[[[[null,[null,0,\"Base Case (Consensus)\",[[0,21,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"$1.35T – $1.80T\",[[0,15,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"~35× – 45× forward P/S\"]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Steady Starlink subscriber growth, commercial direct-to-cell scaling, stable Falcon cadence.\"]]]]]],[null,[[[[null,[null,0,\"Bull Case (Aggressive Expansion)\",[[0,32,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"$2.0T – $2.6T+\",[[0,14,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"\\u003e50× forward P/S\"]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Starship operationalization, orbital data centers/AI compute integration, defense contracts.\"]]]]]]],true]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[null,[null,3,\"Key Upside Catalysts\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[[[[null,[null,0,\"Starlink Scaling \\u0026 Direct-to-Cell Monetization: Continued subscriber adoption past the 8–10 million mark, paired with commercial direct-to-cell telecom rollouts and high-margin enterprise/maritime/aviation contracts, generates predictable recurring revenue.\",[[0,47,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Starship Operational Milestones: Transitioning Starship from test flights to routine orbital payload delivery will dramatically reduce cost-per-kilogram to orbit, accelerating constellation deployment and unlocking deep-space government payloads.\",[[0,32,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Space-Based AI \\u0026 Distributed Compute Infrastructure: Aggressive market speculation around orbital compute nodes, proprietary data infrastructure, and defense-integrated intelligence systems commands tech-scale conglomerate multiples over traditional defense-contractor multiples.\",[[0,52,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[nu