pute nodes, proprietary data infrastructure, and defense-integrated intelligence systems commands tech-scale conglomerate multiples over traditional defense-contractor multiples.\",[[0,52,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"National Security \\u0026 Defense Dominance: Expanding sole-source dependencies from the U.S. Space Force and intelligence agencies (e.g., Starshield and classified tracking constellations) creates steady, government-guaranteed revenue backstops.\",[[0,38,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]]],1]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[null,[null,3,\"Key Downside Risks\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[[[[null,[null,0,\"Multiple Compression \\u0026 Scarcity Premium Unwind: If trading at an enterprise-to\",[[0,47,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]]],1]]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"3.8 Flash\",true,[[[[1004,\"Longer\",5,null,[\"expand\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/expand/default/24px.svg\",null,true]],[1005,\"Shorter\",6,null,[\"compress\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/compress/default/24px.svg\",null,true]],[1002,\"Don't personalize\",2,null,[\"person_cancel\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/person_cancel/default/24px.svg\",null,true]],[1001,\"Try again\",1,null,[\"refresh\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/refresh/default/24px.svg\",null,true]]]]],null,2,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,1,1]"]]
