lights to routine orbital payload delivery will dramatically reduce cost-per-kilogram to orbit, accelerating constellation deployment and unlocking deep-space government payloads.\",[[0,32,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Space-Based AI \\u0026 Distributed Compute Infrastructure: Aggressive market speculation around orbital compute nodes, proprietary data infrastructure, and defense-integrated intelligence systems commands tech-scale conglomerate multiples over traditional defense-contractor multiples.\",[[0,52,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"National Security \\u0026 Defense Dominance: Expanding sole-source dependencies from the U.S. Space Force and intelligence agencies (e.g., Starshield and classified tracking constellations) creates steady, government-guaranteed revenue backstops.\",[[0,38,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]]],1]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[null,[null,3,\"Key Downside Risks\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[[[[null,[null,0,\"Multiple Compression \\u0026 Scarcity Premium Unwind: If trading at an enterprise-to-sales ratio above 40×, any macroeconomic rotation away from mega-cap growth or post-secondary/IPO float unlocks can trigger severe multiple contractions toward fundamental discounted cash flow (DCF) baselines (~$780B–$1.25T).\",[[0,47,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Capital Expenditure \\u0026 Starship Delays: Development bottlenecks, launch aborts, or regulatory delays with\",[[0,38,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]]],1]]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"3.8 Flash\",true,[[[[1004,\"Longer\",5,null,[\"expand\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/expand/default/24px.svg\",null,true]],[1005,\"Shorter\",6,null,[\"compress\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/compress/default/24px.svg\",null,