ity Premium Unwind: If trading at an enterprise-to-sales ratio above 40×, any macroeconomic rotation away from mega-cap growth or post-secondary/IPO float unlocks can trigger severe multiple contractions toward fundamental discounted cash flow (DCF) baselines (~$780B–$1.25T).\",[[0,47,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Capital Expenditure \\u0026 Starship Delays: Development bottlenecks, launch aborts, or regulatory delays with the FAA/environmental agencies regarding Starship cadence would postpone critical Starlink V3 deployments and Moon landing schedules.\",[[0,38,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Orbital Spectrum \\u0026 Regulatory Headwinds: Direct-to-cell expansion requires international spectrum coordination (ITU/FCC) and faces interference litigation from terrestrial telcos and rival satellite operators.\",[[0,40,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Key Person \\u0026 Concentration Risk: Operations and market narrative remain heavily tied to leadership continuity, cross-entity resource sharing, and political-regulatory relationships.\",[[0,32,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]]],1]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[null,[null,0,\"References \\u0026 Data Sources:\",[[0,26,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[[[[null,[null,0,\"Markets.com – SpaceX Valuation \\u0026 Stock Price Projections\",[[0,56,[null,[\"https://www.markets.com/analysis/spacex-stock-price-prediction\"]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"FutureSearch.ai – SpaceX Valuation Models and Sum-of-the-Parts Forecasts\",[[0,72,[null,[\"https://futuresearch.ai/spacex-ipo-valuation/\"]]]]]]]]]]]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"3.8 Flash\",true,[[[[1004,\"Longer\",5,null,[\"expand\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/expand/default/24px.svg\",null,true]],[1005,\"Shorter\",6,null,[